

<%args>
$operator
$date
$project
$location
@cvterms
</%args>


<%perl>
use Tie::UrlEncoder;

our %urlencode;
my $encoded_operator = $urlencode{$operator};
my $encoded_date     = $urlencode{$date};
my $size = "small";
</%perl>


<center>
<h1>CASSAVABASE 多條碼工作單(CASSAVABASE MULTI-BARCODE SHEET)</h1>

<br />
<br />
<div class="boxbgcolor5">
請掃描下列條碼一次(Scan the following barcodes once)
</div>

<table>
<tr><td><font size="4">操作人員(Operator)</font></td>

<td><img src="/barcode/image/?code=O:<% $encoded_operator %>&size=<% $size %>" /></td></tr>

<tr><td><font size="4">今日日期(Today's Date)</font></td>
<td><img src="/barcode/image/?code=D:<% $encoded_date %>&size=<% $size %>" /></td></tr>
<tr><td><font size="4">專案/試驗(Project)</font></td>

<td><img src="/barcode/image/?code=P:<% $project %>&size=<% $size %>" /></td></tr>
<tr><td><font size="4">地點(Location)</font></td>
<td><img src="/barcode/image/?code=L:<% $location %>&size=<% $size %>" /></td></tr>
</table>


<br /><br /><br /><br />


<div class="boxbgcolor5">
掃描待調查表型的植株條碼，接著掃描表型條碼，然後在數字鍵盤上輸入數字(Scan the barcode for the plant to be phenotyped, then scan the phenotype barcode, then enter the number on the keypad)
</div>


<table border="0" cellpadding="20">
<%perl>

foreach my $t (@cvterms) { 
     my $definition = $t->{cvterm_definition};
     $definition =~ s/(.{40})/$1\<br \\\>/g; 
     print qq { <tr><td><img src="/barcode/image/?code=$t->{cvterm}&size=$size" /></td><td>$definition</td></tr> };

}

</%perl>
</table>
</center>


